{"id":"d9de3791ae9122ae","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-ad-cone.md","title":"AD 下的 Martin 锥定理","display":"thm-ad-cone — AD 下的 Martin 锥定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-ad-cone","aliases":["20-thm-ad-cone"],"display":"thm-ad-cone — AD 下的 Martin 锥定理","chapter":"15","section":"15.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 15.1.3；ZF+AD 元理论范围的本地说明","source_pdf_pages":[248],"source_printed_pages":[219],"depends_on":["[[20-df-gale-stewart]]","[[20-df-principal-filter]]"],"ambient_theory":"ZF+AD"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-ad-cone"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-ad-cone</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ad-cone — AD 下的 Martin 锥定理"},{"key":"chapter","html":"15"},{"key":"section","html":"15.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 15.1.3；ZF+AD 元理论范围的本地说明"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>248</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>219</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab\" href=\"?note=f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab\" title=\"20-df-gale-stewart\">20-df-gale-stewart</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4b426f126126a9e1\" href=\"?note=4b426f126126a9e1\" title=\"20-df-principal-filter\">20-df-principal-filter</a></span></div>"},{"key":"ambient_theory","html":"ZF+AD"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>本条的工作元理论为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ZF+AD\">\\(ZF+AD\\)</span>。AD 断言：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G(A)\">\\(G(A)\\)</span> 确定；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\mathcal D\">\\(S\\subseteq\\mathcal D\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab\" href=\"?note=f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab\" title=\"20-df-gale-stewart\">20-df-gale-stewart</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4b426f126126a9e1\" href=\"?note=4b426f126126a9e1\" title=\"20-df-principal-filter\">20-df-principal-filter</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ad\\text{-}cone}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D\\\n[\\mathcal D_{\\ge\\mathbf a}\\subseteq S\\lor\\mathcal D_{\\ge\\mathbf a}\\cap S=\\varnothing].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ad\\text{-}cone}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D\\\n[\\mathcal D_{\\ge\\mathbf a}\\subseteq S\\lor\\mathcal D_{\\ge\\mathbf a}\\cap S=\\varnothing].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\{X:\\deg_T(X)\\in S\\}\">\\(D=\\{X:\\deg_T(X)\\in S\\}\\)</span>。AD 给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G(D)\">\\(G(D)\\)</span> 的胜策。将一个胜策按其全部回合的固定有效枚举编码为实 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a=\\deg_T(s)\">\\(\\mathbf a=\\deg_T(s)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>若 I 必胜，给任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf b\\ge\\mathbf a\">\\(\\mathbf b\\ge\\mathbf a\\)</span> 取代表 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span>。让 II 在奇数坐标逐位输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span>，I 依 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 回应。整局 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 可由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\oplus s\\equiv_TY\">\\(Y\\oplus s\\equiv_TY\\)</span> 计算，且奇数列直接给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\le_TX\">\\(Y\\le_TX\\)</span>，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\deg_T(X)=\\mathbf b\">\\(\\deg_T(X)=\\mathbf b\\)</span>。胜策给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in D\">\\(X\\in D\\)</span>，故整个锥在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 中。若 II 必胜，改让 I 在偶数坐标输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span>，同样 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\equiv_TY\">\\(X\\equiv_TY\\)</span>，但此时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\notin D\">\\(X\\notin D\\)</span>，整个锥与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 不交。</p>\n<p>已目视核对 PDF 第 248 页：原书 II 情形末句写的是补集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline A\">\\(\\overline A\\)</span>，方向正确。抽取文本遗漏了这条补集横线；旧稿把抽取结果当成原页并误报笔误，现撤销该来源误报。本文用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\\setminus S\">\\(\\mathcal D\\setminus S\\)</span> 表示同一补集方向。证明只需这个度不变游戏确定，AD 是充分的明确附加假设，原书明确指出 AD 与全体集合的选择公理 AC 不相容；采用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ZF+AD\">\\(ZF+AD\\)</span> 才使该条件定理具有非空的理论背景。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 219 / PDF 248。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-gale-stewart","status":"resolved","id":"f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-gale-stewart]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-principal-filter","status":"resolved","id":"4b426f126126a9e1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-principal-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-gale-stewart","status":"resolved","id":"f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-gale-stewart]]；see [[20-df-principal-filter]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-principal-filter","status":"resolved","id":"4b426f126126a9e1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-gale-stewart]]；see [[20-df-principal-filter]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"ZF+AD","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"G(A)","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ad\\text{-}cone}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D\\\n[\\mathcal D_{\\ge\\mathbf a}\\subseteq S\\lor\\mathcal D_{\\ge\\mathbf a}\\cap S=\\varnothing].","display":true},{"tex":"D=\\{X:\\deg_T(X)\\in S\\}","display":false},{"tex":"G(D)","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf a=\\deg_T(s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf b\\ge\\mathbf a","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"Y\\oplus s\\equiv_TY","display":false},{"tex":"Y\\le_TX","display":false},{"tex":"\\deg_T(X)=\\mathbf b","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in D","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"X\\equiv_TY","display":false},{"tex":"X\\notin D","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D\\setminus S","display":false},{"tex":"ZF+AD","display":false}],"bytes":2146,"backlinks":[{"id":"15cf85fd84eaf3f9","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"构造与来源：[[20-lem-finite-tree-switches]]、[[20-thm-minimal-below-ce]]、[[20-thm-relative-complement]]、[[20-df-pa-degree]]、[[20-thm-ad-cone]]。极小度存在性构造仍需补证。"}],"outgoing":["f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab","4b426f126126a9e1"]}